# The complimentary-bag ladders

> Module AirlineAllowance

> Using AirlineWorld as W
> Using Airline as A

A concolic harness, not part of the port.

The Complimentary Bags section grades an allowance by elite status and by
military status, and both ladders are functions of one enumeration.  Neither
touches an itinerary, so both are encodable, and between them CUTECat has to
find every rung: five statuses and three military tiers.

`effective_status` --- "the benefits are based on your highest status level at
time of ticketing or check-in" --- is the one rule here that takes a whole
itinerary, so its comparison is restated over the two statuses directly rather
than called.  This is the one place in this file where the harness computes
something instead of calling the port, and it is a two-line rule that
`Airline.effective_status` states the same way.

```catala-metadata
declaration scope Allowance:
  input status_at_ticketing content W.EliteStatus
  input status_at_checkin content W.EliteStatus
  input military content W.MilitaryStatus
  output ticketing_rank content integer
  output checkin_rank content integer
  ## The better of the two, per "highest status level at time of ticketing or
  ## check-in".
  output effective_rank content integer
  ## Free bags on the elite ladder, at the effective status.
  output status_bags content integer
  ## "1st - 5th bags free of charge" on orders; 1st--3rd on personal travel.
  output military_bags content integer
  ## The allowance the passenger receives on these two grounds: the best of
  ## them, not their sum.
  output free_bags content integer
```

```catala
scope Allowance:
  definition ticketing_rank equals A.status_rank of status_at_ticketing
  definition checkin_rank equals A.status_rank of status_at_checkin

  definition effective_rank equals
    if ticketing_rank >= checkin_rank then ticketing_rank else checkin_rank

  definition status_bags equals
    if ticketing_rank >= checkin_rank
    then A.status_free_bags of status_at_ticketing
    else A.status_free_bags of status_at_checkin

  definition military_bags equals A.military_free_bags of military

  definition free_bags equals
    if status_bags >= military_bags then status_bags else military_bags
```
